commit 48c183b0432b7f12a0885ecaed0bfc861d4d4b58

C03: calculator arithmetic, client GUI navigation, network scans and file downloads are known unsupported effects (LIMITS1683)

«multiplicá 6 por 7 en la calc» and «Suma 2 más 2 en la Calculadora» ask to chain controls the product presses one at a time with a confirmation; «Abre Steam y luego navega por la gui hasta biblioteca» and «Abre Epic Games y navega hasta la biblioteca» ask to walk a game client's interface; «qué redes wifi hay» asks for a scan (the status reader read it as wifi.status, the state of the PC's own radio); «descarga la imagen de portada de wikipedia.org y guardala en el escritorio» asks for a download. No operation serves them: four known_unsupported_effect_request contracts (calculator.expression.evaluate, client.gui.navigate, wifi.scan, browser.download.file) close the turn as a plain limit naming the request; the network listing is excluded from the wifi.status domain; downloads, arithmetic and scans are request heads.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


